        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2154, Narrow Rectangular Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Narrow Rectangular Passage Pocket Door Set comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware. It has a contemporary appearance that makes it a great choice for almost any home renovation. Perfect for pocket doors, the Emtek made 2154 Narrow Rectangular Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is installed by mortising it into the door. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick. The trim plates are 1/8 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2156\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2155\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2153\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Passage Narrow Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2154-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262402\"><b>Emtek 2154 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
